+The standings have four aligned columns: #, Driver, Points, Gap. The player's actual row has a two-pixel yellow outline and is brought into the scroll viewport after layout. Its values come from the model/backend: the ranked layout fixture shows its real fixture values, while the live observer has not raced and correctly retains no rank/zero points. No example score is inserted into a live account. The separate `YOU -- 0 pts` footer, visible `TEST` badges and `TEST RIVALRY` diagnostic footer are removed as explicitly requested. Raw server identity/population flags and public ranking isolation remain intact.
