+The backdrop and compact cutout were produced using the built-in imagegen tool, then copied into `game/assets/menu/rivalry_winter_v1.png` and `rivalry_compact_cutout_v1.png`. Both have mipmaps; the compact retains real alpha, verified through Godot. Originals remain untouched. Saved exact [generation/edit prompts](RIVALRY_REFERENCE_PROMPTS.md), provenance and hashes accompany the assets. The owner's reference screenshot is not shipped. Added source PNG bytes total 3,872,876; actual mobile texture-memory/frame performance is not measured by this pass.
