+# Rivalry reference asset prompts - 2026-10-07
+
+Built-in imagegen was used. The owner's results-screen reference guided the interface; it was not used as a shipping texture. The landscape is newly generated, and the transparent car derives only from the project's existing original fictional compact illustration.
+
+## Landscape
+
+Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: original ultra-wide panoramic raster backdrop for a premium fictional compact-car racing game championship menu, landscape aspect ratio about 2.3:1. Create an original mature inked and cel-shaded alpine winter landscape: layers of dramatic distant snow-covered mountain peaks across the upper middle, deep blue pine forests at the left and right edges, a peach-violet twilight sky above the mountains, very faint cleared compact race-road traces winding among the snow-covered trees in the lower foreground. Broad controlled tones, finely inked silhouettes and authored crisp forms, believable scale, natural restrained navy/blue/icy-grey palette with subtle warm cloud accents, atmospheric depth, painterly graphic-novel environment consistent with a cel-shaded overhead racer. Quiet open upper band behind interface headings; the skyline remains visible across the top 30 percent. Lower 65 percent darker and lower contrast to sit behind dark opaque UI panels. Landscape only. No cars, no people, no text, no logo, no user interface, no table, no frame or vignette. Do not copy a specific screenshot or recognizable real place. High quality original shipping-candidate background, readable large shapes, no photographic texture noise.
+
+Saved as `game/assets/menu/rivalry_winter_v1.png`. Source output: `exec-d0dcdf71-e079-46b7-b289-e87bbb0f674f.png` in the built-in generated-images directory. Original output retained.
+
+## Compact cutout
+
+Use case: background-extraction. Asset type: original game podium vehicle cutout with genuine transparency. Input image: project-owned compact-car illustration is the edit target and identity/style reference. Extract only the single complete fictional cream and navy-blue compact hatchback from this original illustration onto a fully transparent background. Keep the exact car design, front-left three-quarter orientation, cream upper body with navy lower sides and cream stripe, twin circular headlights, believable compact-car body proportions, wheels, glass, detailed black ink outlines and mature matte cel-shaded painting style. Keep all bodywork and all visible wheels intact; do not change the vehicle, add badges, introduce brand names, or turn it into a sports car. Remove the navy studio backdrop and ground plane completely; retain only a subtle tight translucent contact shadow immediately under the tires. Centre the car in a wide landscape canvas with small transparent margins, so the full car fills most of the image and is legible when scaled into a podium card. No text, no logo, no border, no extra vehicles, no checkerboard painted into the image.
+
+Saved as `game/assets/menu/rivalry_compact_cutout_v1.png`. Edit target: `game/assets/menu/compact_illustration_v1.png`. Source output: `exec-0ed3808f-d019-4815-bb01-d9c9e0d52c5a.png`. Original target and output retained. Alpha must remain intact in the imported UI texture; this is podium presentation and does not alter the car model, livery contract or handling.
